## Task 3: Find Hidden Pages

### Objective

Discover hidden directories on the FakeBank website using Dirb.

### Tool Used

Dirb

### Command

dirb [http://fakebank.thm](http://fakebank.thm)

### Notes

* Dirb is a directory brute-forcing tool.
* It searches for hidden folders and files on a web server.
* Any result beginning with '+' indicates a discovered directory.

### Hidden Directories Found

1. [http://fakebank.thm/images](http://fakebank.thm/images)
2. [http://fakebank.thm/bank-transfer](http://fakebank.thm/bank-transfer)

**Answer:**
[http://fakebank.thm/bank-transfer](http://fakebank.thm/bank-transfer)

